     "ec14477a-c4a7-413b-a2ec-6660e1ac489a"], Cell[
    "for each edge, the number of observers through it", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"b1e2a14c-dc87-4798-aaba-f0fa67114ac8"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
